---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Events
eyebrow: Calendar
lede: Information sessions, application deadlines, visiting scholar lectures and showcases from the Office of Global Engagement. Everything here is open to the School community unless noted.
description: "Upcoming events and deadlines from the Office of Global Engagement: practicum information sessions, From Texas to the Troubles meetings, lectures and showcases."
permalink: /events/
---
{% include "components/page-hero.njk" %}

<div class="container layout-sidebar">
  <div>
    <div class="flow mb-6">
      <h2 id="what-we-host">What OGE hosts</h2>
      <p>Throughout the year the Office of Global Engagement (OGE) brings the School's global community together in Walter Webb Hall and online. Expect <strong>information sessions</strong> for the Global Practicum, May Term courses and From Texas to the Troubles; <strong>application deadlines</strong> that matter for students planning a semester abroad; <strong>visiting scholar lectures</strong> from partner universities such as Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile and Tallinn University; and <strong>showcases</strong> where returning students present what they learned alongside their communities abroad.</p>
      <p class="small muted">Times are Central Time. Each event has its own link, so you can share it directly (for example, from an email or a course page).</p>
      <p class="notice notice--warn"><strong>Draft calendar.</strong> The dates, times and locations listed below are placeholders pending confirmation by OGE. Confirmed events will replace them before launch.</p>
      <!-- VERIFY: every entry in src/_data/events.json carries a "_verify" note; no event dates, rooms or application deadlines appear in docs/CONTENT-SOURCES.md. -->
    </div>

    <section aria-labelledby="upcoming-title">
      <div class="section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Upcoming</p>
          <h2 class="section__title" id="upcoming-title">Events &amp; deadlines</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if eventsSorted.upcoming.length %}
        {% for event in eventsSorted.upcoming %}
          <article class="event-detail" id="{{ event.id }}">
            <p class="eyebrow">{{ event.type }}</p>
            <h2>{{ event.title }}</h2>
            <dl class="event-detail__meta">
              <dt>When</dt>
              <dd><time datetime="{{ event.start }}">{{ event.start | date("cccc, LLLL d, yyyy") }}</time>{% if event.end and event.end != event.start %} – <time datetime="{{ event.end }}">{{ event.end | date("cccc, LLLL d, yyyy") }}</time>{% endif %}</dd>
              {% if event.time %}<dt>Time</dt><dd>{{ event.time }}</dd>{% endif %}
              {% if event.location %}<dt>Where</dt><dd>{{ event.location }}</dd>{% endif %}
              {% if event.audience %}<dt>Audience</dt><dd>{{ event.audience }}</dd>{% endif %}
              {% if event.initiative %}<dt>Program</dt><dd>{{ event.initiative }}{% if event.region and event.region != "Global" %} · {{ event.region }}{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
            </dl>
            {% if event.description %}<p>{{ event.description }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if event.registration %}
              <p class="mt-0"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="{{ event.registration }}"{% if event.registration.startsWith("http") %} rel="noopener"{% endif %} aria-label="Register or learn more: {{ event.title }}">Register or learn more</a></p>
            {% endif %}
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        <div class="empty-state">
          <p><strong>No upcoming events are scheduled right now.</strong> Join the <a href="/connect/listserv/">OGE listserv</a> to hear about the next information session or deadline as soon as it is announced.</p>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    {% if eventsSorted.past.length %}
      <section class="mt-6" aria-labelledby="past-title">
        <div class="section__head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Archive</p>
            <h2 class="section__title" id="past-title">Past events</h2>
            <p class="section__intro">A record of recent lectures, showcases and public events. Many of them become <a href="/stories/">Global Stories</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% for event in eventsSorted.past %}
          <div id="{{ event.id }}" class="event-detail event-detail--past">
            {% include "components/event-card.njk" %}
            {% if event.description %}<p class="small muted mt-0" style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">{{ event.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </section>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <aside class="rail" aria-label="Events sidebar">
    <div class="rail-block">
      <h2 class="rail-heading">Add OGE to your calendar</h2>
      <p class="small">OGE events also appear on the <a href="https://socialwork.utexas.edu/events/">School of Social Work calendar</a>. When this site moves to WordPress, the two calendars will be synced so every OGE event is listed in both places.</p>
      <p class="small">The surest way to hear about information sessions and deadlines first is the listserv.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="/connect/listserv/">Join the listserv</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rail-block">
      <h2 class="rail-heading">Host an event with OGE</h2>
      <p class="small">Faculty, student organizations and partner institutions are welcome to propose a lecture, panel, film screening or visiting scholar talk. Tell us about your idea and we will help with space, promotion and logistics.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--outline btn--sm" href="/connect/">Propose an event</a>
    </div>
    <div class="rail-block">
      <h2 class="rail-heading">Related</h2>
      <ul class="rail-links">
        <li><a href="/education/student-opportunities/">Student opportunities</a></li>
        <li><a href="/education/practicum/">Global Practicum</a></li>
        <li><a href="/education/from-texas-to-the-troubles/">From Texas to the Troubles</a></li>
        <li><a href="/education/projects-with-underserved-communities/">Projects with Underserved Communities</a></li>
        <li><a href="/stories/">Global Stories</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

{% include "components/cta-band.njk" %}
